<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title
      >We didn’t find rivals for your ASIN – let’s take a closer look</mj-title
    >
    <mj-font
      name="Inter"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
    />
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF">
    <mj-wrapper css-class="main" padding="0">
      <adv-header />

      <para>
        Hi <b style="font-weight: 500 !important">{{ first_name }}</b>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Sorry, but our analysis didn't identify any great market opportunities
          for
          <a
            style="color: #088ab2; font-weight: 400 !important"
            href="https://amazon.{{ amazon_tld }}/dp/{{ client_asin }}"
            >{{ client_asin }}</a
          >
          right now.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          We are in BETA testing so this may be due to a technical error. Or it
          could be that your ASIN is performing really strongly.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text padding="0" css-class="description">
          Book a meeting with our team and we can discuss how we unlock the full
          potential of your ASIN.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text css-class="text-font">
          We look forward to chatting with you!
        </mj-text>
      </para>
      <para classes="greeting-text">
        <mj-text padding="0" css-class="description"
          >Thanks for your understanding.</mj-text
        >
      </para>

      <ai-cta
        classes="btn-wrapper"
        link="https://revup{{ app_subdomain_suffix }}.amaizing.io/book-your-session?uuid={{uuid}}"
        text="Let's meet!"
      >
      </ai-cta>

      <footer classes="footer-sec" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
